# game/script.rpy:948
translate Chinese after_load_2f24a960:

    # "Since you last played this save we have added the ability to set a last name/family name to use when characters formally address the main character."
    "自从您上次玩这个存档后，我们添加了一项功能，允许设置姓氏/家族名称，以便角色在正式场合称呼主角时使用。"

# game/script.rpy:950
translate Chinese after_load_700f3954:

    # "Please choose a last name to make sure nothing breaks."
    "请选择一个姓氏，以避免出现问题。"

# game/script.rpy:1036
translate Chinese start_423d8f63:

    # "This game contains explicit sexual visuals. If you prefer, you can choose to disable these images."
    "本游戏包含露骨的性爱画面。如果您觉得不适，可以选择禁用这些图像。"

# game/script.rpy:1038
translate Chinese start_124f53bf:

    # "Please note that this will only affect the visual content and not the text. As a result, there may be instances where the visuals do not align with the text description."
    "请注意，这只会影响视觉呈现，不会影响文字内容。因此，可能会出现画面与文字描述不符的情况。"

# game/script.rpy:1040
translate Chinese start_6515430b:

    # "But it'll keep you safe from prying eyes during gameplay. You will still unlock related images in the game's gallery even if you choose to disable this option."
    "但这能让您在游戏过程中避免被他人窥视。即使您选择禁用此选项，您仍然可以在游戏图鉴中解锁相关图片。"

# game/script.rpy:1051
translate Chinese start_341f4155:

    # "This game may contain visual and descriptive scenes that depict physical injuries."
    "本游戏可能包含视觉和文字场景，其中可能描绘身体损伤。"

# game/script.rpy:1053
translate Chinese start_4b32b0e4:

    # "These scenes are not intended to linger or glorify for shock value, they are simply meant to depict some of the realities of working on a ship during this time period and should be suitable for most players."
    "这些场景并非为了博人眼球而刻意渲染或夸大，仅仅是为了如实展现那个时期在船上工作的一些现实情况，相信大多数玩家都能接受。"

# game/script.rpy:1055
translate Chinese start_5963b7ce:

    # "However, if you prefer, you can choose to have these scenes toned down."
    "但是，如果您觉得不适，可以选择弱化这些场景。"

# game/script.rpy:1057
translate Chinese start_9aa934ec:

    # "While these scenes will still be included for narrative purposes, we will do our best to navigate around them. For instance, your character might look away or leave the room when these scenes occur."
    "虽然这些场景仍然会为了剧情连贯性而保留，但我们会尽量避免直接展示。例如，当这些场景发生时，您的角色可能会转移视线或离开房间。"

# game/script.rpy:1068
translate Chinese start_b5d71b1f:

    # "And lastly, you can hide/unhide this text box at any point by hitting {u}H{/u} if you're playing with Keyboard and Mouse, or {u}swipe down{/u} on touchscreen devices."
    "最后，如果您使用键盘和鼠标，可以按{u}H{/u}键随时隐藏/显示此文本框；如果您使用触摸屏设备，则可以{u}向下滑动{/u}。"

# game/script.rpy:1080
translate Chinese start_484b05e4:

    # "Today is the day—your final moments on dry land before beginning your life at sea."
    "今天是你的特别日子——在你开始海上生活之前，这是你在陆地上的最后时光。"

# game/script.rpy:1082
translate Chinese start_d42eb731:

    # "It seems surreal; it's only been a week since you left the farmstead you grew up on, yet it almost feels as if a lifetime has slipped by."
    "感觉真有点不真实；自从你离开从小长大的农舍才一周，却好像已经过去了一辈子。"

# game/script.rpy:1084
translate Chinese start_17728d34:

    # "The uneventful journey along the rugged path from your humble village to the vibrant port city has ignited something within you. It seems like the past weeks have been the most thrilling days of your twenty year existence; and they're only the start of the adventure yet to come."
    "从你那简陋的村庄沿着崎岖的小路一路来到繁华的港口城市，这段看似平淡的旅程却点燃了你内心的激情。你觉得过去的几周简直是你二十年来最刺激的日子；而这还仅仅是一场伟大冒险的开始。"

# game/script.rpy:1086
translate Chinese start_3c830f05:

    # "At least, that's what you keep telling yourself."
    "至少，你一直这样告诉自己。"

# game/script.rpy:1088
translate Chinese start_463338eb:

    # "Beneath the tumultuous excitement at the surface, a lingering anxiety sits heavy in your stomach, keeping it tense. Nerves and fear intertwine, casting doubt on this sudden life change."
    "在表面涌动的兴奋之下，一丝挥之不去的焦虑沉甸甸地压在你的胃里，让你感到一阵紧张。紧张和恐惧交织在一起，让你开始怀疑自己一时冲动做出的这个决定。"

# game/script.rpy:1090
translate Chinese start_20306cc0:

    # "Ship masts start to come into view, emerging above nearby rooftops as you approach. Their stark looming presence against the morning sky only serving to amplify your emotions, further unsettling your stomach as you turn the corner onto the bustling main road which leads straight to port."
    "当你逐渐靠近港口，桅杆开始映入眼帘，它们高耸在附近的屋顶之上。在晨曦的映衬下，它们显得格外醒目，更加剧了你心中的各种情绪，让你感到一阵反胃。转过街角，通往港口的主路就在眼前，那里熙熙攘攘，热闹非凡。"

# game/script.rpy:1092
translate Chinese start_115f351c:

    # "Maybe skipping breakfast today would have been a wise choice."
    "也许今天就该不吃早餐。"

# game/script.rpy:1094
translate Chinese start_7c167e76:

    # "The coastal breeze kicks up, giving you the strongest hit of salty air yet. Another reminder of what you are so close to doing—a new life on the deck of a ship, surrounded by endless miles of ocean."
    "海风裹挟着浓烈的海腥味扑面而来，让你再次意识到自己即将开始新的生活——登上远洋航船，与茫茫大海为伴。"

# game/script.rpy:1096
translate Chinese start_5a28d3c2:

    # "Are cats really made for life on the seas?"
    "猫这种生物真的适合在海上生活吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1098
translate Chinese start_35e2ec77:

    # "{cps=2}. . .{/cps}"
    " {cps=2}...{/cps}"

# game/script.rpy:1100
translate Chinese start_8afacf61:

    # "As you traverse the bustling thoroughfare leading to the docks, the familiar aroma of the nearby fisheries fills the air. The scent of fresh seafood intermingles with the salty tang of the sea—a pungent reminder of the lively nature of this quarter of the city."
    "走在通往码头的喧嚣大街上，空气中弥漫着附近渔场特有的气味。新鲜海产的鲜味与海水的咸味交织在一起，时刻提醒着你这里是全城最热闹的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:1102
translate Chinese start_6da817b4:

    # "The path is adorned with an array of shops and stalls; each proudly showcasing their own bountiful catches for the day. Their colorful displays of fresh seafood entice passersby, while diligent merchants busily prepare for the gathering crowds."
    "道路两旁，各色店铺和小摊鳞次栉比，争相展示着当天捕获的海鲜。新鲜的海货色彩鲜艳，引得路人驻足，而勤劳的商贩们则忙着为即将到来的客流做准备。"

# game/script.rpy:1104
translate Chinese start_a32a7e10:

    # "As the path nears its end, the smaller shops give way to grander structures that house shipwrights and shipping companies. These sturdy buildings stand as beacons of industry, eagerly accepting work from any ship that makes port."
    "当道路快要走到尽头时，小店铺逐渐被大型建筑所取代，这里聚集着造船厂和航运公司。这些坚固的建筑如同行业灯塔，热情地欢迎着每一艘进港的船只。"

# game/script.rpy:1106
translate Chinese start_10201b0e:

    # "Of course, no port town is complete without its share of dockside taverns, and this bustling city is no exception. The closest tavern echoes with boisterous shouts and drunken songs, drawing in sailors and locals alike."
    "当然，没有哪个港口城市会少了路边酒馆，这座繁华的城市也不例外。最近的酒馆里传出喧闹的叫喊声和醉醺醺的歌声，吸引着水手和当地居民。"

# game/script.rpy:1108
translate Chinese start_fa977a11:

    # "As you pause near the tavern, you finally get your first unobstructed glimpse of the ships. You have a direct view of awe-inspiring vessels that gracefully ride the gentle roll of the sea. Among them, one is about to become your new home."
    "你在酒馆附近停下脚步，终于可以毫无遮挡地欣赏到那些船只了。那些雄伟壮丽的船只在海面上轻轻摇曳，其中一艘即将成为你的新家。"

# game/script.rpy:1110
translate Chinese start_a6adc943:

    # "This is the very beginning of the grand adventure you have been dreaming of for years."
    "你梦寐以求的伟大冒险，终于要拉开帷幕了。"

# game/script.rpy:1112
translate Chinese start_f274a3a0:

    # man1 "Out of the way!"
    man1 "让开！"

# game/script.rpy:1114
translate Chinese start_a6c0b996:

    # "A slurred voice commands as a burly otter emerges from the tavern, shouldering his way through the crowd."
    " 一个含糊不清的声音传来，只见一个身材魁梧的水獭从酒馆里走了出来，一边嚷嚷着一边用肩膀在人群中开路。"

# game/script.rpy:1116
translate Chinese start_4b9aa1c2:

    # "Lost in your thoughts, you find yourself rudely knocked to the ground by the shove. The sudden impact jolts you back to reality, quickly reminding you of the chaotic nature of port life."
    " 你沉浸在思绪中，没留神被他撞倒在地。这突如其来的撞击让你瞬间清醒，也让你意识到港口生活充满了混乱。"

# game/script.rpy:1118
translate Chinese start_2d9ba243:

    # "A groan escapes your lips as you climb back to your feet. The otter is already lost in the crowd, just another sailor with one too many pints in him too early in the day. It's a sight you know you will be growing accustomed to in your new life."
    " 你呻吟着爬了起来。那个水獭已经消失在人群中，只是一个在白天就喝得酩酊大醉的普通水手。你知道，在未来的日子里，你肯定会经常见到这样的景象。"

# game/script.rpy:1124
translate Chinese start_78f97eaa:

    # "Any lingering frustration from the fresh bruise on your shoulder dissipates as you break through the dense crowd and reach the water's edge. Your eyes widen in awe as they fixate on the magnificent ship docked right before you."
    "肩头那块新淤青带来的不快，也在你挤出人群，来到水边时消散殆尽。你瞪大了眼睛，被眼前这艘雄伟的巨轮震慑住了。"

# game/script.rpy:1126
translate Chinese start_123e8730:

    # "A fully rigged beauty adorned with three majestic masts that soar high above her deck. The meticulously carved and painted lettering across the stern proudly displays the name of the vessel, a name that signifies the place that is about to become your new home."
    "这真是一艘漂亮的三桅战舰，高耸的桅杆直插云霄。船尾雕刻精美的文字骄傲地宣示着它的名字——这名字也预示着你即将落脚的新家。"

# game/script.rpy:1128
translate Chinese start_a1b403ed:

    # "\"{i}Conway{/i}\""
    "“{i}Conway{/i}”"

# game/script.rpy:1130
translate Chinese start_be8f7eba:

    # "A name that fills you with the same sense of passion and adventure that brought you all this way. A name you yearn to utter with pride in the days to come. You silently rehearse it within your thoughts, savoring each letter as it swirls and dances in your mind."
    "这个名字让你热血沸腾，也让你觉得一路风尘仆仆赶来是值得的。你恨不得能立刻自豪地喊出它。你在心里默默念叨着，细细品味着每个字母在脑海里跳跃。"

# game/script.rpy:1132
translate Chinese start_6577adbb:

    # "It has a nice ring to it!"
    "这名字真带劲！"

# game/script.rpy:1134
translate Chinese start_3bb7cbbc:

    # q "What're you doing there?!" with hpunch
    q "你干什么呢？！" with hpunch

# game/script.rpy:1136
translate Chinese start_68044c0d:

    # "Once again, you're startled from the hazy daydreams of your mind, instantly turning to the source of the bellowed voice."
    "你又一次从白日梦里惊醒，立马循声望去。"

# game/script.rpy:1147
translate Chinese start_99aecb69:

    # "Before you stands a towering horse clad in a tight-fitting blue uniform, his hair tied back in a neat knot behind his head. He looms at least three heads above you, forcing you to tilt your head back to meet his piercing gaze."
    "只见一匹高头大马站在你面前，穿着紧绷的蓝色制服，头发在脑后扎成一个利落的发髻。他足足比你高出三个头，你不得不仰起脖子才能看到他那双锐利的眼睛。"

# game/script.rpy:1149
translate Chinese start_1997f041:

    # horse "You hear me?"
    horse "听见我说话了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1151
translate Chinese start_12a4c225:

    # horse "We're on a tight schedule, and the last thing I need is some idiot gettin' crushed by a crate because he's gawkin' at the ships."
    horse "咱们时间紧得很，我可不想哪个蠢货光顾着看船，被箱子压死！"

# game/script.rpy:1153
translate Chinese start_f1c0e50f:

    # horse "So..."
    horse "所以..."

# game/script.rpy:1155
translate Chinese start_364cd120:

    # "The horse snorts heavily."
    "那马重重地哼了一声。"

# game/script.rpy:1157
translate Chinese start_12b8b6d1:

    # horse "Get out of the way!"
    horse "滚开！"

# game/script.rpy:1162
translate Chinese start_10986a5f:

    # "You're left feeling helpless as you stand there, unaware of the problem at hand. You finally grasp the situation when you instinctively look up and notice the crate suspended in mid-air, connected to a sturdy dock crane."
    "你愣在原地，完全摸不着头脑，不知所措。抬头一看，才发现一个箱子悬在半空，正连着码头上结实的起重机。"

# game/script.rpy:1168
translate Chinese start_5568bcb2:

    # "A group of workers eagerly awaits the crate's arrival on the ship, while others work diligently to guide it from the ground, with you in the way."
    "一群工人正等着把箱子卸到船上，还有些人在地面引导，而你正好挡在中间。"

# game/script.rpy:1170
translate Chinese start_34041cc7:

    # "! ! !"
    "! ! !"

# game/script.rpy:1172
translate Chinese start_88d3b89a:

    # "You quickly scurry out of the way of danger, sheepishly watching as the crate is carefully lowered to the men on the ship."
    "你赶紧灰溜溜地躲开，有些尴尬地看着箱子被小心地放到船上工人的手中。"

# game/script.rpy:1174
translate Chinese start_b5cb0c34:

    # "Great. Not even on the ship yet and you've already made a fool of yourself."
    "真是棒极了。还没上船就先闹了个笑话。"

# game/script.rpy:1176
translate Chinese start_6114bbfa:

    # man1 "Easy now. Slow. Slow it... A bit more!"
    man1 "都小心着点！慢点！再慢点！"

# game/script.rpy:1180
translate Chinese start_b7279098:

    # man1 "...And down. Now! Keep it slow and steady. Slow. Slooow. Damn it, I said slow! Are you deaf? She's not your wife. Treat her gently, you son of a bitch!"
    man1 "……放！就现在！都轻拿轻放的！轻点！轻~~点！他娘的，说了轻点！她又不是你媳妇儿？都他娘的温柔点！"

# game/script.rpy:1184
translate Chinese start_94612ee2:

    # "Reluctantly, you approach the horse again, sure that he must be the one in charge with how he's barking orders."
    "你硬着头皮又走到那匹马跟前，看他吆五喝六的样子，肯定是个管事的。"

# game/script.rpy:1189
translate Chinese start_c94ed8f2:

    # pS "Sorry about that sir! I'm new. One of the new recruits signed up to join the Conway. Could you tell me where I should be?"
    pS "长官！对不住！我是新来的，刚报名加入“Conway”号。您能告诉我该去哪儿报到吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1191
translate Chinese start_5d177212:

    # "The horse doesn't seem to have heard you. Or care. His attention is focused only on his work, keeping an eye on every barrel and crate coming from the nearby warehouse and heading for the ship."
    "那马好像压根没听见，或者说根本不在乎。他两眼只盯着手头的工作，密切注视着从仓库运来的每一个桶和箱子。"

# game/script.rpy:1193
translate Chinese start_0add45a9:

    # "Frustrated, you clear your throat and try again in a louder tone."
    "你有点恼火，清了清嗓子，又大声问了一遍。"

# game/script.rpy:1195
translate Chinese start_9523e541:

    # pS "Sir? I'm here to joi-"
    pS "先生？我是来加-"

# game/script.rpy:1199
translate Chinese start_d6a9fcb3:

    # horse "Yes. I heard you."
    horse "听见了。"

# game/script.rpy:1203
translate Chinese start_66ee68a3:

    # "He's quick to interrupt you, sparing only a momentary glance in your direction before his booming voice shouts at someone near the warehouse."
    "他飞快地打断了你，只瞥了你一眼，就冲着仓库那边的人吼道："

# game/script.rpy:1206
translate Chinese start_a1629a97:

    # horse "JEFFERY! WE'RE TWO SHORT! GET THOSE FIRST!"
    horse "JEFFERY！还差两个人手！先紧着把那俩补上！"

# game/script.rpy:1208
translate Chinese start_0af3f878:

    # man1 "Got it, sir!"
    man1 "明白，长官！"

# game/script.rpy:1212
translate Chinese start_f613ded3:

    # "The horse turns his attention back to you, narrowing his gaze with a deep scowl."
    "那马转过头，眯起眼睛，狠狠地瞪着你。"

# game/script.rpy:1216
translate Chinese start_18465cc7:

    # horse "You're one of the new ones? ... Great. How about you don't get in the way every chance you can."
    horse "你是新来的？……很好。最好给我老实点，别没事找事！"

# game/script.rpy:1218
translate Chinese start_140f419c:

    # pS "I'm really sorry sir! I'll be more careful in the future."
    pS "真的很抱歉，先生！我以后会更加小心的。"

# game/script.rpy:1223
translate Chinese start_79d8ba8f:

    # "The horse snorts, clearly unconvinced. His steely gaze lingers long enough to make you squirm before he pulls out a leather-bound book and leafs through the pages."
    "马喷着响鼻，显然不相信。他锐利的目光盯着你，盯得你浑身不自在。他这才拿出一本皮面书，翻了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:1225
translate Chinese start_1f939b0a:

    # a "That's Officer to you from now on, got it? Officer Arthur Hudson. What's your name, recruit? I don't think I see 'Clueless Fool' in here."
    a "以后叫我长官，听明白了吗？Arthur Hudson长官。你叫什么，新兵？我这儿本子上可没写着谁叫“笨蛋”这个名字。"

# game/script.rpy:1331
translate Chinese day1_postnameselection_a5ee472d:

    # a "Well, shit. You weren't even joking."
    a "好吧，玩真的啊。"

# game/script.rpy:1333
translate Chinese day1_postnameselection_cea747b9:

    # a "[name] [family_name], arrived and accounted for. Get up there and wait at the fore, recruit. You'll be instructed after loading is done."
    a "[name] [family_name]，已到达并报到。新兵，去前面等着。装货结束之后会有人指示你的。"

# game/script.rpy:1338
translate Chinese day1_postnameselection_8c315922:

    # "Navigating around the busy crewmen, you cautiously tread upon the unsteady gangway, feeling it sway beneath your paws with each gentle roll of the sea."
    "你小心地绕开忙碌的船员，谨慎地走上摇摇晃晃的舷梯，感觉到脚下的木板随着海浪的轻微起伏而晃动。"

# game/script.rpy:1340
translate Chinese day1_postnameselection_79ca15f2:

    # "You proceed cautiously, each step measured and deliberate, as if the slightest misstep could send you tumbling into the water. You can't help but feel the crew's eyes on you, perhaps amused by the new recruit's struggle to simply walk."
    "你小心翼翼地往前走，每一步都仔细掂量过，生怕一不小心就掉进海里。你感觉船员们的目光都集中在你身上，可能觉得这新来的家伙连路都走不稳，挺好笑的。"

# game/script.rpy:1347
translate Chinese day1_postnameselection_b2844dbb:

    # "Finally, your feet find solid ground as you step onto the deck, a wave of relief washing over you. It may not have been the smoothest start to your first day on the ship, but you reassure yourself that confidence will come with time. This is, after all, what you've always wanted."
    "终于，你双脚踏上了坚实的甲板，一阵轻松感涌上心头。虽然第一天上船的开局不太顺利，但你安慰自己说，自信总会随着时间慢慢培养起来的。毕竟，这就是你一直向往的生活。"

# game/script.rpy:1349
translate Chinese day1_postnameselection_65f34fac:

    # "Regaining your footing on the stable deck, you stride purposefully towards the foremast, mindful of the instructions given to you. Best to avoid any further trouble that would come from sightseeing."
    "在平稳的甲板上站稳后，你牢记指示，径直朝前桅走去。最好还是别惹麻烦，免得因为东张西望再惹出什么事端。"

# game/script.rpy:1351
translate Chinese day1_postnameselection_21e069a4:

    # "Focused on your tasks, you navigate the ship with purpose, eager to prove yourself in your new role. Surprisingly, you spot two others already waiting in the designated spot. It takes but a moment for you to put it together. More new recruits just like you."
    "你专注于自己的任务，在船上穿梭，渴望尽快证明自己的价值。令人意外的是，你发现已经有两个人在指定地点等候。你立刻意识到，他们和你一样，都是新来的。"

# game/script.rpy:1364
translate Chinese day1_postnameselection_3a17fd03:

    # "The one in the back, a weathered wolf in his mid-thirties, bears the marks of time and hardships on his face. Lost in his thoughts, he flicks a coin with practiced ease, catching it repeatedly, absorbed in deep contemplation."
    "站在后面的那人是一只饱经风霜的狼，三十多岁的年纪，饱经风霜的脸上写满了岁月的痕迹。他沉浸在自己的思绪里，手法娴熟地抛着一枚硬币，又稳稳地接住，全神贯注，不知道在想些什么。"

# game/script.rpy:1366
translate Chinese day1_postnameselection_b5dffec7:

    # "You can't help but wonder how he, at his age, became one of the ship's new recruits."
    "你忍不住好奇，他这把年纪怎么也成了新兵。"

# game/script.rpy:1368
translate Chinese day1_postnameselection_b174982e:

    # "The other figure, a youthful lizard, appears much more suited for the role. From the looks of it, he couldn't be older than just about twenty, if even that."
    "另一位是年轻的蜥蜴，看起来倒是挺适合这份工作。看样子，他顶多也就二十岁，甚至可能更小。"

# game/script.rpy:1370
translate Chinese day1_postnameselection_f8c4ad07:

    # "From his spot leaned up against the mast, the lizard lets his inquisitive gaze focus on you, a faint smirk tugging at his lips."
    "蜥蜴斜靠在桅杆上，带着一丝意味深长的微笑，饶有兴致地打量着你。"

# game/script.rpy:1396
translate Chinese firstchoice_greet_5d5dac8b:

    # p "Aye."
    p "嗯。"
    #Aye 是一个比较古老、带有地域或特定语境色彩的英语词，最常见的意思是 “是的”“没错”。
    #这里需要翻译完后测试，根据场景换词

# game/script.rpy:1398
translate Chinese firstchoice_greet_7c490602:

    # wolf "Aye."
    wolf "嗯。"

# game/script.rpy:1400
translate Chinese firstchoice_greet_3fbd2da0:

    # liz "Would you look at that. A cat! Not going to be at each other's throats immediately, are you?"
    liz "瞧瞧这是谁。一只猫！你们俩不会一见面就掐起来吧？"

# game/script.rpy:1402
translate Chinese firstchoice_greet_f36d6781:

    # p "Hadn't planned on it. You two new as well?"
    p "没打算那样。你们也是新来的？"

# game/script.rpy:1404
translate Chinese firstchoice_greet_2d689573:

    # "The wolf simply nods. He doesn't seem to be the chatty type."
    "狼只是点了点头，看来他不太爱说话。"

# game/script.rpy:1411
translate Chinese firstchoice_greet_9c4722b2:

    # j "New Landsman, yes. Julian. Sure it will be great working with you!"
    j "我是新来的，Julian。很高兴能和你们一起工作！"

# game/script.rpy:1413
translate Chinese firstchoice_greet_0c1ef4bd:

    # p "Pleasure's all mine. Can't wait to be scrubbing the whole ship with the two of you."
    p "我也很荣幸。真等不及和你们一起刷船了。"

# game/script.rpy:1417
translate Chinese firstchoice_greet_77416f5f:

    # "Julian's smile curls up adorably across his reptilian muzzle. Seems he found your little icebreaker rather amusing."
    "Julian咧开嘴，爬行动物般的脸上露出了可爱的笑容，看来他觉得你这句开场白挺有意思。"

# game/script.rpy:1433
translate Chinese firstchoice_quiet_77cecdd2:

    # "Without a word, you join the two in waiting, leaning your shoulder up against the mast next to the lizard."
    "你没说话，走到他们身边，靠着桅杆和蜥蜴并肩站着。"

# game/script.rpy:1440
translate Chinese firstchoice_quiet_c9b2af5e:

    # liz "Not going to say anything?"
    liz "不说两句吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1442
translate Chinese firstchoice_quiet_bd952281:

    # j "Figured you might have trouble with the wolf, being a cat and all, but didn't think you'd give me the cold shoulder. Name's Julian."
    j "我还以为你看到狼会不自在呢，毕竟你是只猫嘛，没想到你竟然直接给我脸色看。我叫Julian。"

# game/script.rpy:1444
translate Chinese firstchoice_quiet_1a476a3d:

    # "You fold your ears back sheepishly, offering a friendly smile to the lizard."
    "你有些不好意思地往后缩了缩耳朵，朝蜥蜴友善地笑了笑。"

# game/script.rpy:1446
translate Chinese firstchoice_quiet_d00bb2f1:

    # p "Oh yes, sorry. I didn't mean any offense. I'm [name]. Nice to meet you Julian."
    p "哦，抱歉。我不是故意冒犯你的。我叫[name]，很高兴认识你，Julian。"

# game/script.rpy:1448
translate Chinese firstchoice_quiet_21bbc16a:

    # "Julian remains silent for a moment, a mischievous smirk gracing his lips as he studies you with an intense gaze. "
    "Julian沉默了片刻，脸上带着一丝顽皮的笑容，饶有兴致地打量着你。 "

# game/script.rpy:1456
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_abf132f7:

    # "Searching for a way to keep the conversation going, you subtly gesture toward the crew members who are busily loading the ship."
    "你想找个话题继续聊下去，便不着痕迹地指了指那些忙着往船上装货的船员们。"

# game/script.rpy:1458
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_b3a144e5:

    # p "I can't believe how quickly they work. I think I'd be lost just trying to make it from here to the warehouse."
    p "真不敢相信他们干活这么快。我觉得我从这儿走到仓库都得迷路。"

# game/script.rpy:1460
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_d4bb6956:

    # j "It's like a well-oiled machine. All the crew working together and knowing exactly what to do. No wonder they wanted us over here and out of the way."
    j "简直就像一台运转良好的机器。所有船员齐心协力，都知道自己该做什么。怪不得他们要把我们打发到这边来，免得碍事。"

# game/script.rpy:1462
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_43b282db:

    # j "I bet most of the crew are seasoned vets. Makes sense they work so smoothly."
    j "我敢说啊，这船上多半都是些老油条。怪不得干活这么利索。"

# game/script.rpy:1466
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_7efd797f:

    # j "Did you hear? Some guy must have got in their way a bit ago. Could hear the screaming from up here!"
    j "听说了没？ 好像是有人不长眼，惹到他们了。我老远就听见那叫声了！"

# game/script.rpy:1468
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_bb805eeb:

    # p "Oh.. uh. Yeah, I heard."
    p "哦……啊，听说了。"

# game/script.rpy:1470
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_3607ee39:

    # "You're thankful not everyone saw the commotion you caused earlier; you quietly hope that Julian doesn't pry any further, allowing the incident to fade into oblivion."
    "真是谢天谢地，没多少人注意到我之前闹出的动静。就希望Julian别再追问了，赶紧把这事儿忘了吧。"

# game/script.rpy:1474
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_2eea007d:

    # p "It feels strange just sitting here while everyone works, though."
    p "不过，大伙儿都在忙活，就我搁这儿闲坐着，总觉得有点怪怪的。"

# game/script.rpy:1476
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_956d14bc:

    # j "It does, doesn't it?"
    j "可不是嘛。"

# game/script.rpy:1478
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_4b12e0e0:

    # p "Feels like I'm just a passenger, I guess."
    p "感觉自己就是个搭船的，唉。"

# game/script.rpy:1480
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_2baa462a:

    # "Your words nudge Julian towards a new topic."
    "你这话一说，Julian立马就转移了话题。"

# game/script.rpy:1482
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_4db9bd0c:

    # j "Passenger, huh? You ever been on a ship before?"
    j "搭船的？你以前上过船吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1484
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_d5871c2f:

    # p "Never. I've dreamed of it, but I was tied to my home until now. But I have to admit, I'm excited!"
    p "从来没有。我倒是做梦都想，可之前一直被家事绊着。不过说真的，我挺兴奋的！"

# game/script.rpy:1486
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_ea040406:

    # "Julian seems surprised by the revelation. Guess it's not every day a new recruit has never even seen a ship before."
    "Julian听了这话，好像有点吃惊。估计很少有新来的，连船都没见过的。"

# game/script.rpy:1488
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_f3f23683:

    # j "Really? Well, you're in for something then. It's not for everyone. Hope you get your sea legs quick."
    j "真的吗？那你可有得体验了。这可不是谁都受得了的。希望你能早点适应船上的生活海腿。"
    #get your sea legs = 适应海上的生活，尤其是适应船只摇晃、不再晕船。指人在摇晃的甲板上也能保持平衡、正常行走的能力。

# game/script.rpy:1490
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_4b8a153b:

    # p "Not your first time sailing?"
    p "你不是第一次出海吧？"

# game/script.rpy:1492
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_574b96e0:

    # j "Few trips here and there. Dad's in the navy, so I grew up with it all. Just never done anything this big."
    j "跑过几趟。我老爹是海军，我从小就跟着沾光。就是没见过这么大的阵仗。"

# game/script.rpy:1494
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_b11a018c:

    # p "The navy? Not surprising you'd end up working on a ship as well."
    p "你爹是海军？难怪你最后也跑船上来了。"

# game/script.rpy:1496
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_b42e31b5:

    # j "Not the first time I've heard that. Must be in my blood, huh?"
    j "这话我可没少听。看来我天生就是吃这碗饭的，啊？"

# game/script.rpy:1500
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_ceffef06:

    # j "Better hope you don't get seasick immediately. I can't promise I won't laugh if I see you hurling off the edge of the ship."
    j "你可千万别一上来就晕船啊。要不然我看到你趴在船边上吐，可不保证不笑出声。"

# game/script.rpy:1502
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_ba42c10c:

    # "Julian's jest comes with a mischievous glint in his eyes."
    " Julian说着玩笑话，眼睛里闪着坏笑。"

# game/script.rpy:1506
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_42cca550:

    # p "Thanks for being so supportive..."
    p "多谢您嘞，真是太照顾我了……"

# game/script.rpy:1509
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_22f5fe88:

    # wolf "I'll fetch you a bucket. That enough support?"
    wolf "我给你弄个桶来，够意思了吧？"

# game/script.rpy:1517
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_e71ac4f4:

    # "The wolf's deep voice interrupts the conversation from behind you, drawing your attention. You glance over your shoulder to see him still engrossed in his coin, its polished surface gleaming in the sunlight as he expertly flips it through the air."
    " 一个低沉的嗓音从你身后传来，打断了你们的谈话，你回头一看，是那头狼，正盯着手里的硬币玩呢，那硬币在阳光底下闪闪发光，被他抛来抛去，花里胡哨的。"

