    # p "Very kind of you."
    p "您真是太客气了。"

# game/script.rpy:1527
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_2b4b05a9:

    # p "I think I'd like to assume I'll be fine. I don't need yet another thing to worry about."
    p "我还是先当自己没事吧。我可不想再多一件闹心的事儿了。"

# game/script.rpy:1529
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_4ea2516a:

    # j "Time will tell, though I'm sure you'll be fine."
    j "走着瞧吧，不过我相信你肯定没问题的。"

# game/script.rpy:1537
