# game/script.rpy:1552
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_81d3ef99:

    # "You can't help but frown. Was it really that common?"
    "你忍不住皱起了眉头。 这种事很常见吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1556
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_2096f27a:

    # p "Lucky guess? I didn't think it happened that often. But yes, I wanted a chance to see the world. The tales from the sailors passing through my town were always so thrilling."
    p "瞎蒙的吧？ 我还以为没那么多人呢。 不过说真的，我就是想见见世面。 以前我们镇上总有水手路过，他们说的那些故事，可惊险刺激了。"

# game/script.rpy:1558
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_900459e6:

    # p "I guess I just needed to see something other than this town."
    p "我只是想看看外面的世界。"

# game/script.rpy:1560
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_ed5b488c:

    # "Feeling self-conscious, you try to think of a way to put it into words."
    "你有点不好意思，想了想该怎么说。"

# game/script.rpy:1562
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_0ee2dd91:

    # "The way the ocean has always seemed to offer an escape for you—how boxed in your village was, save for the endless expanse of sea..."
